```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "publish a persona's Handle card onto the WHO board"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///face.handle.publishes", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.handle.publishes"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/face.handle.publishes"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! face.handle.publishes ~ a persona's public here-I-am note, announced

`lares handle publish <glamour>` mints the persona's Handle (its self-certifying card on the handle-KEL, anchored to the persona-KEL prefix) under the glamour (display name) and announces it onto the Nexus WHO board. The glamour rides seat 1 or `glamour=`; `persona=<index>` names the persona.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ publish

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`publish` params=`name/Guru-Josh ~ publish a Handle`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ name · glamour · persona

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`name` params=`takes/glamour seat/1 as/<glamour> ~ the glamour, the display name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`glamour` params=`takes/glamour ~ the glamour, as a flag`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`persona` params=`takes/index ~ the persona whose Handle acts; absent, the store door's default`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ hand

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`hand` params=`who/seat-or-hand key/handle-head ~ the store door signs on the WHO board under the Handle's key`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · store-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[face.handle.publishes name/Guru-Josh]] ~ publish wants a glamour`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`store-refused` params=`~ the store door refused; the line names why`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ published

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`published` params=`exit/0 ~ the card's glamour, nym and act`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares handle publish

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares handle publish]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

